    <string name="raba_strength_summary" formatted="false">100% is HyperOS\'s level. Above it every touch adds a few clean beats at the motor\'s own frequency, up to a 4D game hit at 150%. In long fast typing the extra beats give way as the motor warms; the tick itself never dims.</string>

